        "title": "Recontexualizing Social Media (Wrong Answers Only)",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/214723/Recontexualizing-Social-Media-Wrong-Answers-Only",
        "content_text": "Over on BlueSky, Firaxis narrative director Cat Manning created a thread to collect <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/catacalypto.bsky.social/post/3mx3ysoom6227\">instances of people riffing on social media posts by giving them bizzare context</a>. (SLBlueSky)",
