        "content_text": "My conversation with Dan Gookin, the original For Dummies author and now mayor of Coeur d’Alene, Idaho, started as a publishing reunion. It ended with a much larger question: What happens when the software you rent becomes infrastructure you can’t leave? There was something wonderfully circular about hearing Dan Gookin tell me that, after he [&#8230;]",
