        "title": "How Deaf people experience the power of classical music",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/214724/How-Deaf-people-experience-the-power-of-classical-music",
        "content_text": "How Deaf people experience the power of classical music.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-09-12/how-deaf-people-connect-with-music-beethoven-to-haptic-vests/107129188\">Deaf musicians have shaped classical music for centuries, but only recently have innovations like haptic vests and Auslan signers enabled deeper connections.</a>",
        "type": "Internet",
