        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/safari-27.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple may be preparing to track when Google promotes Chrome or the Google app to users browsing in Safari, and how users react to those promotions. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios-27-2,safari\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072788\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/05/apple-may-soon-track-when-google-promotes-chrome-inside-safari/#more-1072788\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
