        "title": "This tool frees up Apple Intelligence storage on macOS, but think twice before using it",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/05/this-tool-frees-up-apple-intelligence-storage-on-macos-but-think-twice-before-using-it/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/apple-intelligence-macOS-27.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A new open-source tool is going viral over its promise to let users who aren’t interested in Apple Intelligence reclaim 12GB or more of storage on their Macs. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-intelligence,macos-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072799\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/05/this-tool-frees-up-apple-intelligence-storage-on-macos-but-think-twice-before-using-it/#more-1072799\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
