        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/02/deals-m5-macbook-air-pro-airtag-2-iphone-18-cases/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/Apple-deals-MacBook-chargers-AirTag-2-iPhone-18-Pro-cases.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Alongside the launch of the all-new Twelve South Airfly Drive wireless CarPlay adapter at $40, Amazon has once again updated its early fall Prime Day sale with fresh deals. Today’s <em>9to5Toys Lunch Break</em> is headlined by Apple AirTag 2 down at Amazon all-time low pricing. We also have Sharge’s metal 300W smart display power bank at $50 off<strong>,</strong> loads of new all-time lows on Belkin’s 25W MagSafe charging stations, and the now live official fall Prime Day deals on the Eve Matter/HomeKit plugs, light switches, outlets, and more from $32. Scope it all out below. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"9to5toys,9to5toys-lunch-break,deals\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072383\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/02/deals-m5-macbook-air-pro-airtag-2-iphone-18-cases/#more-1072383\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
