        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/01/apple-commissions-photographers-for-new-shot-on-iphone-duo-campaign/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/iphone-duo-camera.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today, Apple’s Instagram account published a carousel featuring photos commissioned from photographers Jake Michaels and Jason Nocito to highlight the new <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/iphone-duo/\">iPhone Duo</a>’s cameras. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone-duo,shot-on-iphone\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072344\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/01/apple-commissions-photographers-for-new-shot-on-iphone-duo-campaign/#more-1072344\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
