        "title": "SpaceXAI releases a separate Grok iOS app for enterprise users",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/01/spacexai-releases-a-separate-grok-ios-app-for-enterprise-users/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/grok-intune.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Back in May, OpenAI <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/04/openai-releases-a-separate-chatgpt-ios-app-for-schools-and-work-organizations/\">released</a> a dedicated version of their mobile app for enterprise. Now SpaceXAI is doing the same thing for Grok.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,apps,grok,spacexai\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072301\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/01/spacexai-releases-a-separate-grok-ios-app-for-enterprise-users/#more-1072301\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
