        "title": "ESPN app recently got big upgrade on Apple TV 4K and iPhone",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/01/espn-app-recently-got-big-upgrade-on-apple-tv-4k-and-iphone/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/05/espn-streaming-service-flagship.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fall is a big season for sports fans, and ESPN recently launched a big upgrade for users of its tvOS and iOS apps: 4K HDR streaming.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv,espn\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072291\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/01/espn-app-recently-got-big-upgrade-on-apple-tv-4k-and-iphone/#more-1072291\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
