        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/apple-invites.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple is rolling out a new version of its Apple Invites app for iPhone today. The update taps into new iOS 27 features, including improved photo sharing and Image Playground capabilities. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apps\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072163\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/30/apple-invites-for-iphone-updated-with-three-new-features/#more-1072163\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
