        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/30/early-launch-deals-live-apple-latest-releases/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/New-Apple-gear.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple unleashed a collection of next-generation products this month, from the new AirPods 5 and Beats 360 ANC headphones (last day for the launch discount), the Apple Watch Series 12 and Ultra 4, right through to the latest M6-powered Mac mini and Mac Studio. All of which are accompanied by a series of new accessories. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Amazon is also carrying over a number of launch discounts on some of them courtesy of its early fall Prime Day sale for folks looking to jump in now, and we have collected all of them for you below. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072147\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/30/early-launch-deals-live-apple-latest-releases/#more-1072147\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
